                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>This course is designed for first-year clinical medicine students, providing systematic instruction through clinical experts from affiliated hospitals and research institutes. It delivers a comprehensive overview of the current landscape, cutting-edge advances, and emerging directions in biomedical sciences, with particular emphasis on clinical medicine. The program aims to cultivate students' preliminary understanding of professional development pathways, academic planning strategies, and research orientation, thereby establishing a solid foundation for their future academic growth and career advancement.</p></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
